#: lib/pesque_web/page_html.ex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A personal data server for the atproto network. It stores an account's records, signs every change and answers the network on its own. Self-hosted, so the data stays where its owner put it."
msgstr "Um personal data server da rede atproto. Guarda os registros de uma conta, assina cada mudança e responde à rede sozinho. Self-hosted, então os dados ficam onde quem cuida deles deixou."

#: lib/pesque_web/page_html.ex:114
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
